# tests/run_serial_tests.py's pristine copies of the two files the suite
# rewrites in place. Transient -- taken inside the run lock and removed on the
# way out -- but a run killed by SIGKILL leaves one behind on purpose, so that
# the next invocation can repair from it. Never committed.
*.serial-runner-pristine-*
.serial-runner-tmp-*
